            name="errorHandler" visibility="protected" ><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219ab19.71806562" name="return" direction="return"><type xmi:idref="63a4c6d209e429.79234751"/></ownedParameter><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219ab31.28263567" name="$errno" direction="in"><type xmi:idref="63a4c6d209e2f2.35908695"/></ownedParameter><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219ab83.70979191" name="$errmsg" direction="in"><type xmi:idref="63a4c6d209e2b6.20155476"/></ownedParameter><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219abd5.63277944" name="$errfile" direction="in"><type xmi:idref="63a4c6d209e2b6.20155476"/><defaultValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralString" xmi:id="63a4c6d21e32e6.11025548" value="&#039;&#039;" /></ownedParameter><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219ac35.13230789" name="$errline" direction="in"><type xmi:idref="63a4c6d209e2f2.35908695"/><defaultValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralString" xmi:id="63a4c6d21e3303.14181703" value="0" /></ownedParameter><ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment"
                xmi:id="63a4c6d21e3332.48308126" annotatedElement="63a4c6d219a9e6.48988176"><body>Reports an error number and string.</body></ownedComment></ownedOperation><ownedOperation xmi:id="63a4c6d219b136.68647941" 
            name="recordLastTransactionID" visibility="protected" ><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219b208.27855442" name="return" direction="return"></ownedParameter><ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment"
                xmi:id="63a4c6d21e3385.87761390" annotatedElement="63a4c6d219b136.68647941"><body>Extract and return the ID of the last SMTP transaction based on a list of patterns provided in SMTP::$smtp_transaction_id_patterns.
Relies on the host providing the ID in response to a DATA command.
If no reply has been received yet, it will return null.
If no pattern was matched, it will return false.</body></ownedComment></ownedOperation><ownedOperation xmi:id="63a4c6d219b781.98251411" 
            name="getLastTransactionID" visibility="public" ><ownedParameter xmi:id="63a4c6d219b880.32638918" name="return" direction="return"></ownedParameter><ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment"
                xmi:id="63a4c6d21e33f2.43697659" annotatedElement="63a4c6d219b781.98251411"><body>Get the queue/transaction ID of the last SMTP transaction If no reply has been received yet, it will return null.
If no pattern was matched, it will return false.</body></ownedComment></ownedOperation><ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment"
                xmi:id="63a4c6d21e3437.30967964" annotatedElement="63a4c6d2186547.70864334"><body>PHPMailer RFC821 SMTP email transport class.
Implements RFC 821 SMTP commands and provides some utility methods for sending mail to an SMTP server.</body></ownedComment></packagedElement></packagedElement></packagedElement>
