lt mapped from the `$path` filename's extension)</param><param>string $disposition Disposition to use: `inline` (default) or `attachment`</param><return>bool True on successfully adding an attachment</return><throws>Exception</throws></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d21635b0.99819642"><param>string $string The attachment binary data</param><param>string $cid Content ID of the attachment; Use this to reference</param><param>string $name A filename for the attachment. If this contains an extension,</param><param>string $encoding File encoding (see $Encoding), defaults to 'base64'</param><param>string $type MIME type - will be used in preference to any automatically derived type</param><param>string $disposition Disposition to use</param><throws>Exception</throws><return>bool True on successfully adding an attachment</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2163fc1.13526199"><param>string $encoding</param><return>bool</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2164395.57814105"><param>string $cid</param><return>bool</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2164715.38832026"><return>bool</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2164a23.72446653"><return>bool</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2164d16.86552056"><return>bool</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2164f99.15151253"><param>string $kind 'to', 'cc', or 'bcc'</param></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d21663f4.77010461"><param>string $msg</param></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2166b54.70474990"><return>string</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2166e52.94548196"><return>string</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2167690.47362461"><param>string $host The host name or IP address to check</param><return>bool</return></php:docblock><php:docblock base_Element="63a4c6d2167db5.83756024"><param>string $key</param><return>s